{"hymn":"S513","parent":"E618","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"En el monte Calvario estaba una cruz","subtitle":"Gloriarnos en la cruz—La antigua robusta cruz","syl":{"n1":"En","n2":"el","n3":["mon","i"],"n4":["te","t"],"n5":["Cal","i"],"n6":["va","m"],"n7":["rio‿es","m"],"n8":["ta","m"],"n9":["ba‿u","m"],"n10":["na","t"],"n11":"cruz,","n12":"El","n13":["em","i"],"n14":["ble","m"],"n15":["ma","t"],"n16":["de‿a","i"],"n17":["fren","m"],"n18":["ta‿y","t"],"n19":["do","i"],"n20":["lor,","t"],"n22":"Mas","n23":"yo","n24":["a","i"],"n25":["mo‿e","m"],"n26":["sa","t"],"n27":"cruz","n28":"do","n29":["mu","i"],"n30":["rió","t"],"n31":"mi","n32":["Je","i"],"n33":["sús","t"],"n34":"Por","n35":["sal","i"],"n36":["var","t"],"n37":"al","n38":"más","n39":"vil","n40":["pe","i"],"n41":["ca","m"],"n42":["dor.","t"],"n44":"¡Oh,","n45":"yo","n46":["siem","i"],"n47":["pre","t"],"n48":["a","i"],"n49":["ma","m"],"n50":["ré‿e","m"],"n51":["sa","t"],"n52":"cruz!","n54":"En","n55":"sus","n56":["triun","i"],"n57":["fos,","t"],"n58":"mi","n59":["glo","i"],"n60":["ria","t"],"n61":["se","i"],"n62":["rá;","t"],"n64":["Y‿al","i"],"n65":["gún","t"],"n66":["dí","i"],"n67":["a","t"],"n68":"en","n69":"vez","n70":["de‿u","i"],"n71":["na","t"],"n72":"cruz,","n74":"Mi","n75":["co","i"],"n76":["ro","m"],"n77":["na","t"],"n78":["Je","i"],"n79":["sús","t"],"n80":"me","n81":["da","i"],"n82":["rá.","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Aunque el mundo desprecie la cruz de Jesús,","Para mí tiene suma atracción;","Pues en ella llevó el Cordero de Dios","De mi alma, la condenación."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["En la cruz de Jesús do Su sangre vertió,","Hermosura contemplo sin par;","Pues allí mi Jesús padeció y murió","Para darme el perdón y la paz."]}]}